  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DSIF - Bolivia - Three Wind Farms Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will provide access to clean energy through construction of a 93 MW wind farm in three locations around the Provincial Capital of Santa Cruz, delivering on average 267 GWh of electricity a year. The project is the first large-scale investment in wind power in Bolivia, who is presently dependent on fossil fuels (natural gas) for the generation of around two thirds of its electricity.</narrative>
  </description>
